</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Lord is ris’n: with Him we also rose,</l><l>And in His grave see vanquished all our foes.</l><l>The Lord is ris’n: beyond the judgment land,</l><l>In Him, in resurrection-life we stand.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Lord is ris’n: and now redeemed to God,</l><l>We tread the desert which His feet have trod.</l><l>The Lord is ris’n: the sanctu’ry’s our place,</l><l>Where now we dwell before the Father’s face.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Lord is ris’n: the Lord is gone before.</l><l>We long to see Him, and to sin no more.</l><l>The Lord is ris’n: our triumph-shout shall be,</l><l>“Thou hast prevailed! Thy people, Lord, are free!”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
